flowchart TB
  browser[Browser: enam peran dan DTO terbatas]
  subgraph appplane[Application plane]
    web[Next.js / HTTPS frontend]
    api[FastAPI: auth, scope, field policy, masking, audit]
    crypto[dprcrypto: local AEAD, AAD, blind index, TTL cache]
    web -->|HTTPS + verifikasi CA| api
    api --> crypto
  end
  browser -->|HTTPS / cookie secure| web
  subgraph dataplane[Data plane]
    pg[(PostgreSQL 18: ciphertext, wrapped DEK, bidx, REF)]
    rls[Role minimum + RLS + access_scope]
    agg[analyst_summary: HAVING count >= 5]
    pg --- rls
    pg --- agg
  end
  api -->|TLS verify-full: app / analyst / auditor roles| pg
  subgraph keyplane[Key plane]
    bao[OpenBao 2.5.5 / Transit]
    keys[pii-kek / finance-kek / search-hmac]
    bao --- keys
  end
  crypto -->|TLS, svc-app TTL: wrap / unwrap / HMAC| bao
  migration[CLI migrasi: source read-only ke target baru] -->|DEK dan profile| crypto
  migration -->|migration_user sementara| pg
  pg -->|backup_user: pg_dump stdout| backup[Enkripsi streaming + manifest HMAC]
  backup --> store[Arsip terenkripsi terpisah dari kunci backup]
  recovery[Operator / kustodian material recovery privat] -.->|Manual unseal dan rotasi| bao
  store -->|Verifikasi + restore DB baru + validasi + cutover| pg
  lab[Source/baseline plaintext: khusus lab; batas klaim tersendiri] -.-> migration
